      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corolla%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Whalehead Club, built in 1925, served as a private school and later a Coast Guard holding station.",
